# Test files over the budget in tools/tlib/budget.py (docs/TESTING.md, "Budgets").
# <test> <wall ceiling in s> <slow|keep> <reason>
# slow: left out of tools/t affected unless the file itself changed; tools/t full runs it, so the
# nightly and the candidate do. keep: stays in the selection, with this ceiling.
# A new line is an exception: the lead who merges reads its reason. Seeded from full run 3c02b28b49.
